# Filter IEP API

A Flask API to classify generated social media content as:
- OK ✅
- CAN BE FILTERED ⚠️ (Needs rephrasing)
- NOT OK ❌ (Profanity, controversial)

## Inputs

| Field   | Type   | Description                          |
|---------|--------|--------------------------------------|
| text    | string | The generated tweet or post text     |
| theme   | string | (Optional) Content theme (e.g. meme) |

## Example

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:5022/filter \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"text": "This is kinda dumb lol", "theme": "serious"}'
